<TITLE>ETC System Status Display Function</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>When the ETC menu is displayed on the HDD navigation system display, the operating status of the ETC system is displayed in the ETC card message display area as shown in the table (System Status Display List).</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The operating status of the ETC system can also be checked by the illumination/extinguishing or blinking of the ETC unit lights (green and orange).</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<FIGURE>
<GRAPHIC GRAPHICNAME = "a4740091e" WIDTH = "6.903in" HEIGHT = "2.764in" />
</FIGURE>
<TABLE FRAME = "ALL" COLSEP = "1" ROWSEP = "1"><TITLE>System Status Display List</TITLE>
<TGROUP COLS = "4" COLSEP = "1" ROWSEP = "1" TGROUPSTYLE = "Table_10">
<COLSPEC COLNUM = "1" COLNAME = "1" COLWIDTH = "21%"/>
<COLSPEC COLNUM = "2" COLNAME = "2" COLWIDTH = "12%"/>
<COLSPEC COLNUM = "3" COLNAME = "3" COLWIDTH = "12%"/>
<COLSPEC COLNUM = "4" COLNAME = "4" COLWIDTH = "53%"/>
<THEAD>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" MOREROWS = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>ETC Card Message Display Area</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY NAMEST = "2" NAMEEND = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>ETC Unit Light</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "4" MOREROWS = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>ETC On-board Unit Operating Status</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Green</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Orange</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
</THEAD>
<TBODY>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>No Display</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Off</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Off</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "4" CONSPIC = "0"><LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM>
<PTXT>ETC system OFF (power source mode (IG) OFF)</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>ETC Card Not Inserted</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Off</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Off</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "4" CONSPIC = "0"><LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM>
<PTXT>When the ETC card is not inserted (power source mode (IG) ON)</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Authenticating</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Blinking</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Off</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "4" CONSPIC = "0"><LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM>
<PTXT>When an ETC card or setup card is inserted</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Not Set Up</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Off</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Illuminated</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "4" CONSPIC = "0"><LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM>
<PTXT>When the ETC on-board unit registration information is not registered (registration processing has not been performed)</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>ETC Card Error</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Off</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Blinking</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "4" CONSPIC = "0"><LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM>
<PTXT>When a card other than an ETC card is inserted</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>When reading of the ETC card fails</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>When writing to the ETC card fails</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>System Malfunction</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Off</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Blinking</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "4" CONSPIC = "0"><LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM>
<PTXT>When a malfunction occurs in the ETC unit</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>When communication with the roadside radio unit fails</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>When charging processing fails</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>ETC Card Authentication Completed</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Illuminated</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Off</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "4" CONSPIC = "0"><LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM>
<PTXT>When the ETC unit has finished reading the ETC card</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>No Display</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Illuminated</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Illuminated</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "4" CONSPIC = "0"><LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM>
<PTXT>During initial processing (power source mode (IG) OFF → ON)</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "0">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Setup Completed</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Off</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "3" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Off</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "4" CONSPIC = "0"><LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM>
<PTXT>When registration processing is completed</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></ENTRY>
</ROW>
</TBODY>
</TGROUP></TABLE></MECA>